"t": "Gornik HL, et al. 2024 ACC/AHA/Multisociety Guideline for the Management of Lower Extremity Peripheral Artery Disease. Circulation 2024;149:e1313–e1410",
"u": "https://www.acc.org/latest-in-cardiology/ten-points-to-remember/2024/05/09/15/00/2024-guideline-for-lower-extremity-pad"
